---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Prenatal Massage | Nikki Leonardi Bodywork Traverse City" description="Therapeutic prenatal massage that's safe and supportive for mothers-to-be. All products free from ingredients that could put you or your baby at risk.">
  <div class="pt-16">
    <section class="py-24 px-6 bg-[#162040]">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        <p class="section-label mb-4">Prenatal Massage</p>
        <h1 class="font-['Playfair_Display'] text-5xl text-[#f0f4ff] leading-tight mb-6">Therapeutic support<br/>for every stage<br/><em class="text-[#c8a84b]">of pregnancy.</em></h1>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="py-20 px-6 bg-[#0d1428]">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto space-y-6 text-[#c8a84b]/85 leading-relaxed text-lg">
        <p>Prenatal massage is a therapeutic and soothing treatment that's safe and supportive for the mother-to-be. Geared to nurture and alleviate the discomforts unique to pregnancy — shifting posture, round ligament tension, swollen ankles, upper back strain — while honoring the changes your body is moving through.</p>
        <p>All products used are free from any ingredients that could put you or your baby at risk.</p>
        <div class="border border-white/10 p-6 mt-8">
          <p class="section-label mb-4">Session Options</p>
          <div class="space-y-3">
            <div class="flex justify-between items-center">
              <p class="text-[#f0f4ff]">60 Minute Prenatal</p>
              <p class="text-[#c8a84b] font-['Playfair_Display'] text-xl">$100</p>
            </div>
            <div class="w-full h-px bg-white/5"></div>
            <div class="flex justify-between items-center">
              <p class="text-[#f0f4ff]">90 Minute Prenatal</p>
              <p class="text-[#c8a84b] font-['Playfair_Display'] text-xl">$150</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto mt-12">
        <a href="/book" class="btn-primary">Book a Prenatal Session</a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</Layout>
